# L §5.14 A hole in a term: "Only the parts the take could reach under some reading of the holes merge"; L §8.1
# (2.1-F12): "a part whose every possible label is q's is read as q's".  b1 holds two batches of Ania's gifts of one
# day, 9 and 6; its order (k.batch.day, rank[k.owner], rank a hole) ties them.  One sale takes 15, all of both: under
# every reading it takes every part whole, so the take is decided.  q1: b1 is left at 0, and the sale's cash arrives at
# b1c as Ania's by the leg read (3 000.00, carried through).  q2: the leg read of Ania is 15, of each batch its own 9
# and 6.  (Was: the take undecided, and the leg read a hole "b1c: 3 000.00 DUK may be ania's"; the migrator's
# t7_qa_qb, ask qb.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-15
  start 2021-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source src "test"
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
kind funds: unit
kind couples: parties
kind persons: parties
kind gifts: event certain
  leg units: funds
  attr donee: key persons
kind buys: event certain
  leg units: funds
  leg cash: DUK
kind sales: event certain
  leg units: funds
  leg cash: DUK
kind cash_accounts: place one min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(DUK)
  takes k for w order rank[k.owner]
kind lots: holdings
  owned by arrive
  batched
  step 0.0001
  takes k for w order k.batch.day, rank[k.owner]
place b1: lots idx lives 2021-01-01..
place b1c: cash_accounts DUK lives 2021-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2000-01-01..
place market: outside lives 2000-01-01..
input jb: observed
def rank[p in parties]: int = ?"which money leaves first?" at reader
def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule community = (if p == ania_tomek then 1 else 0)
  rule gifted beats community = (if p == m.donee then 1 else 0) when m in gifts
  rule sold beats community = m.units.amount of p / m.units.amount when m in sales

ask q1: bal(b1, 2025-12-31), bal(b1c, 2025-12-31) of ania
ask q2: s.units.amount of ania, s.units.amount of jb[g1], s.units.amount of jb[g2] for s in sales over 2025-03-01..2025-03-01

version cast
  cite src
  known 2021-01-01
  funds + [idx] lives 2018-01-01..
  persons + [ania] lives 1991-03-14..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1989-07-02..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2016-09-10..

version open
  cite src
  governs always
  known 2021-01-01
  opening[b1] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start
  opening[b1c] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start

version j
  cite src
  governs 2025-01..2025-12
  known 2025-01-01
  covers b1, b1c
  jb[g1] = (on: 2025-02-01, kind: gifts, leg units from world to b1 amount 9 idx, donee: ania) "g1"
  jb[g2] = (on: 2025-02-01, kind: gifts, leg units from world to b1 amount 6 idx, donee: ania) "g2"
  jb[s1] = (on: 2025-03-01, kind: sales, leg units from b1 to market amount 15 idx, leg cash from market to b1c amount 3000.00 DUK) "s1"
=== expect
q1: (0 idx, 3 000.00 DUK)
...
q2 (s = jb[s1]): (15 idx, 9 idx, 6 idx)
...
